message: "Cite this research software for persistent-event evaluation and its archived UrbanEV tools. The current manuscript is in paper/persistent_events; historical audit-paper metadata is in docs/history/AUDIT_CITATION.cff."
title: "Persistent Event Evaluation and UrbanEV Research Archive"
version: 0.10.0
type: software
authors:
